nd react to captured orders. Kite is moving toward N-mid, and Orchid is at"},{"seq":1028,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c327","house":"rhino","letter":"L397","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-2","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":5700,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1029,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c328","house":"rhino","letter":"L398","kind":"order","to":"rhino-arch-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":5700,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1030,"t":5700,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1865,"retries":0},{"seq":1031,"t":5700,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 20/30. I need to consolidate my forces and secure key fords. Rhino has units at both F1 and F2, and Tiger at F1 and F3. My units are clustered at KITE CAMP and N-Mid. I will use decoys to draw enemy attention away from a direct assault or consolidation."},{"seq":1032,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c329","house":"kite","letter":"L399","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":6000,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, ITQLD SK JKQSD ATJG WNRS."},{"seq":1033,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c330","house":"kite","letter":"L400","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":6000,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"RNLKJO BKKS, ITQLD SK JKQSD ATJG IEOOHN."},{"seq":1034,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c331","house":"kite","letter":"L401","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":6000,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":"AKWINJ, ITQLD SK JKQSD ATJG WNRS."},{"seq":1035,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c332","house":"kite","letter":"L402","kind":"decoy","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village"],"depart":5700,"plain":"HORSE, ATTACK AT SOUTH BANK EAST.","cipher":null},{"seq":1036,"t":5700,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1851,"retries":0},{"seq":1037,"t":5700,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino is near F1 (N-West/West Ford). Tiger has sent multiple orders towards West Ford/South Bank West. I should reinforce/monitor F1. Tiger's letters suggest movement towards F1/South Bank West, which aligns with my existing forces at F1. I will move my cavalry to scout/threaten "},{"seq":1038,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c333","house":"orchid","letter":"L403","kind":"order","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":6000,"plain":"HORSE, SCOUT WEST FORD.","cipher":"DKQRM, ROKUT WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":1039,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c334","house":"orchid","letter":"L404","kind":"letter","to":"rhino-camp","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1","n-west","rhino-camp"],"depart":6000,"plain":"WE HOLD THE FORDS.","cipher":"WM DKHS TDM AKQSR."},{"seq":1040,"t":5700,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":2044,"retries":0},{"seq":1041,"t":5700,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Watch 20. Tiger must take the west crossing (F1) per doctrine. Rhino is at F1 (6w ago), and Kite/Orchid are nearby. My cavalry at F2 is too far. I will move my infantry/elephants to F1 to secure it, focusing on the west crossing.\n"},{"seq":1042,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c335","house":"tiger","letter":"L405","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp"],"depart":5700,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1043,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c336","house":"tiger","letter":"L406","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-2","path":["tiger-camp"],"depart":5700,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1044,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c337","house":"tiger","letter":"L407","kind":"order","to":"tiger-ele-1","path":["tiger-camp"],"depart":5700,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1045,"t":5700,"type":"delivered","courier":"c316","letter":"L382","house":"kite"},{"seq":1046,"t":5700,"type":"delivered","courier"